{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/thisisgrantlee/status/1987880600661889356","id":"1987880600661889356","text":"Today, as shared by The New York Times, we’re announcing two things:\n\n>Our Series B at a $2.1B valuation led by @sarahdingwang at @a16z.\n>Reaching $100M ARR, profitably, with a team of just 50 people. That's $2M ARR per employee.\n\nPowerPoint was invented before the first website, before the Game Boy, before the Berlin Wall fell.\n\nBut Gamma, and our 70 million users, are proof that an AI-native company can disrupt a category everyone assumed was won.\n\n30 million gammas are created every single month, as we fight hard to become a new standard for communication.\n\nBut we’re not stopping. We’re expanding our plans for businesses. We’re building out a full visual storytelling platform. And today, we’re releasing our API to the general public. So you can plug Gamma into wherever work happens.\n\nAnd to celebrate, we’re also sharing our first ever prompt guide backed by research into how our most successful users use Gamma to automate presentations, websites, and content in minutes.","raw_text":{"text":"Today, as shared by The New York Times, we’re announcing two things:\n\n>Our Series B at a $2.1B valuation led by @sarahdingwang at @a16z.\n>Reaching $100M ARR, profitably, with a team of just 50 people. That's $2M ARR per employee.\n\nPowerPoint was invented before the first website, before the Game Boy, before the Berlin Wall fell.\n\nBut Gamma, and our 70 million users, are proof that an AI-native company can disrupt a category everyone assumed was won.\n\n30 million gammas are created every single month, as we fight hard to become a new standard for communication.\n\nBut we’re not stopping. We’re expanding our plans for businesses. We’re building out a full visual storytelling platform. And today, we’re releasing our API to the general public. So you can plug Gamma into wherever work happens.\n\nAnd to celebrate, we’re also sharing our first ever prompt guide backed by research into how our most successful users use Gamma to automate presentations, websites, and content in minutes.","display_text_range":[0,987],"facets":[{"type":"mention","indices":[112,126],"original":"sarahdingwang","id":"1142210344678379520"},{"type":"mention","indices":[130,135],"original":"a16z","id":"64844802"},{"type":"media","indices":[287,310],"id":"1987871318721679360","display":"pic.x.com/4SApKYltiC","original":"https://t.co/4SApKYltiC","replacement":"https://x.com/thisisgrantlee/status/1987880600661889356/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"thisisgrantlee","url":"https://x.com/thisisgrantlee","id":"1319250540480598026","followers":42926,"following":1142,"likes":4314,"media_count":546,"name":"Grant Lee","description":"Co-founder of @GammaApp","raw_description":{"text":"Co-founder of @GammaApp","facets":[]},"location":"Startup →","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1319250540480598026/1744662992","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1911881270683942912/-AnxBrB8_200x200.jpg","joined":"Thu Oct 22 12:13:45 +0000 2020","protected":false,"website":{"url":"http://gamma.app","display_url":"gamma.app"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":403,"retweets":306,"likes":2781,"bookmarks":1887,"quotes":212,"created_at":"Mon Nov 10 13:50:42 +0000 2025","created_timestamp":1762782642,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":4439350,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"media":{"all":[{"id":"1987871318721679360","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/1987871318721679360/vid/avc1/1920x1080/jO96KGvmnJ1STXv5.mp4?tag=21","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/1987871318721679360/img/fD4qBiilfaxlvamd.jpg","duration":111.402,"width":1920,"height":1080,"format":"video/mp4","type":"video","formats":[{"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/1987871318721679